Package: mhfwupdater
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: mhuxd
Description: firmware updater for microHAM USB devices
 mhfwupdater writes the firmware files (*.cbl) distributed by microHAM to
 their USB devices, which microHAM Router does on Windows. Supported are
 micro KEYER, CW KEYER, DIGI KEYER, micro KEYER II, micro KEYER III,
 DIGI KEYER II, micro KEYER 2R/2R+, micro 2R, Station Master and
 Station Master DeLuxe.
 .
 Before writing, the firmware file is checked against the device's product
 type and hardware revision. Interrupted updates can be finished later.
